    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span><span class=\"time\">20 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">DFS</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Root-to-leaf paths</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/sum-root-to-leaf-numbers/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 129</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Sum Root to Leaf Numbers</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Carry the number built so far down the tree: at each node <code>cur = prefix * 10 + digit</code>, and a leaf hands its <code>cur</code> back up. No strings, no path lists, no backtracking. O(n) time, O(h) space.</p>\n"
